text: >-
  This marks the first oddity: How come we have no communication between the
  lovers

  throughout the day? Lance would not have known where Tyler or his grey Dodge
  Challenger

  had gone, and yet he seems to have made no attempt to find out.To suppose that
  they had

  been in touch would make a nonsense of Tyler telling Lance to look under the
  keyboard - a

  detail that we have argued at length was never part of the initial story.
  Thus, despite killing Kirk,

  returning around 3 or 3:30 pm to try to get the gun (an officer with a dog is
  close by, as we know

  from the at first omitted parts of the text exchange revealed only in the
  search warrants),

  Robinson gives no update as he will do when making his second attempt.
